OL,3,GNEWSAFirm makes funding plea to help
OL,4,AT-level students
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a marketing agency in East
OL,7,FSussex has said the government should
OL,8,Fchange the financial help given to
OL,9,Fsmall businesses to make it easier for
OL,10,Fthem to take on T-Level students.
OL,12,FLast year, a record 20,000 students
OL,13,Fcompleted T-levels, which were
OL,14,Fintroduced in 2020 and combine academic
OL,15,Fstudy with 315 mandatory hours in the
OL,16,Fworkplace.
OL,18,FHowever, colleges in some rural and
OL,19,Fcoastal areas, where most employers are
OL,20,Fsmall businesses, have struggled to
OL,21,Ffind enough firms to host the
OL,22,Fplacements.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
